@switch INTERACT_VERB:
@case "look"
	A dusty journal.
	It's hard to tell how long it's been here.
@case "take"
	Doesn't seem important enough to take.
@case "read"
	"Almost got this whole place cleaned out."
	"Of the important stuff, anyway. Which isn't a lot of it."
	"The idiot dragon doesn't even know we're here."
	"It's too busy loitering in that hall pretending it's important."
	"Is it any wonder the age of dragons ended, with morons like that one at the helm?"
	"Actiones secundum fidei. More later."
	The rest of the journal is blank.
@case else
	Cannot do.
